<title>USA: RXI Holdings says won't make payment on notes.</title>
<headline>RXI Holdings says won't make payment on notes.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>RXI Holdings Inc said it does not plan to make the scheduled January 15 interest payment on its 14 percent senior notes due 2000 series B, and intends to initiate discussions with holders of the notes to renegotiate certain terms.</p>
<p>It said it has retained Houlihan Lokey Howard &amp; Zukin to assist in the evaluation and implementation of various alternatives.</p>
</text>
